  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup butter, room temperature",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "5 eggs, room temperature",
    "1 teaspoon coconut extract",
    "1 cup buttermilk, room temperature",
    "1 cup flaked coconut"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour a 10-inch tube pan (see Cook's Note).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f3C_eLrmcmwpwevz6dex4HV0MsI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15303-coconut-cake-iv-VAT-step-01-3983ba75521e48989e54b91672b81617.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15303/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dKUuxo7PVWoPUSu8LPn8VUEGBfs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15303-coconut-cake-iv-VAT-step-02-2d5f700d9efa46ccaabfef80f0e85fd4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15303/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar together in a separate large bowl with an electric mixer until noticeably lighter in color and fluffy. Add eggs, one at a time, allowing each egg to blend into the beaten butter mixture before adding the next. Mix in coconut extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zMrcvq0a4y_S9eYrZu9oKJzZ7o8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15303-coconut-cake-iv-VAT-step-03-c6cf6c2de2a2458790fd5290f05050c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15303/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in flour mixture alternately with buttermilk, mixing until just incorporated. Fold in coconut, mixing just enough to evenly combine. Pour cake batter into prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/45cLF5ZhOk562xb5Td_ev2rXB5I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15303-coconut-cake-iv-VAT-step-04-7d51435a888142b38afc5c8559d30899.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15303/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the cake comes out clean, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9Id_KIFOywhJOwJGvd3I-5au8gQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15303-coconut-cake-iv-VAT-step-05-dcb7bb0aa17e4537b791c5d4318db19a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15303/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "If desired, frost cooled cake with your favorite buttercream frosting and sprinkle with flaked coconut.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JkM9AjDNj-fiOPt0dc508TrGuPo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15303-coconut-cake-iv-VAT-step-06-fa6671f1e7d64080a18619c57ac1fc4f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15303/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
